second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"When did the Freaky Friday musical begin its performances?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0068-787500caa9a4:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 92, \"text\": \"musical began performances at the Signature Theatre, Arlington, Virginia on October 4, 2016.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0068-787500caa9a4:d00\", \"start\": 93, \"end\": 279, \"text\": \"Directed by Christopher Ashley, with choreography by Sergio Trujillo, the cast features Emma Hunton (as the daughter Ellie), Jason Gotay and Heidi Blickenstaff (as the mother Katherine).\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0068-787500caa9a4:d00\", \"start\": 280, \"end\": 373, \"text\": \"Ashley explained that the musical is based on the original Rodgers book as well as the films.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0068-787500caa9a4:d00\", \"start\": 374, \"end\": 424, \"text\": \"The musical is set in the present time in Chicago.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0068-787500caa9a4:d00\", \"start\": 425, \"end\": 535, \"text\": \"The musical began performances at the La Jolla Playhouse, San Diego, on January 31, 2017, and ran to March 12.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0068-787500caa9a4:d00\", \"start\": 536, \"end\": 589, \"text\": \"The cast features Emma Hunton and Heidi Blickenstaff.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0068-787500caa9a4:d00\", \"start\": 590, \"end\": 615, \"text\": \"This was followed by runs\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0068-787500caa9a4:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 96, \"text\": \"The musical began performances at the Signature Theatre, Arlington, Virginia on January 1, 2018.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0068-787500caa9a4:d01\", \"start\": 97, \"end\": 283, \"text\": \"Directed by Christopher Ashley, with choreography by Sergio Trujillo, the cast features Emma Hunton (as the daughter Ellie), Jason Gotay and Heidi Blickenstaff (as the mother Katherine).\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0068-787500caa9a4:d01\", \"start\": 284, \"end\": 377, \"text\": \"Ashley explained that the musical is based on the original Rodgers book as well as the films.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0068-787500caa9a4:d01\", \"start\": 378, \"end\": 428, \"text\": \"The musical is set in the present time in Chicago.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0068-787500caa9a4:d01\", \"start\": 429, \"end\": 539, \"text\": \"The musical began performances at the La Jolla Playhouse, San Diego, on January 31, 2017, and ran to March 12.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0068-787500caa9a4:d01\", \"start\": 540, \"end\": 593, \"text\": \"The cast features Emma Hunton and Heidi Blickenstaff.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0068-787500caa9a4:d01\", \"start\": 594, \"end\": 620, \"text\": \"This was followed by runs.\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0068-787500caa9a4:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 71, \"text\": \"attemp to win over Katherine to allow Ellie to join them in “ The Hunt.\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0068-787500caa9a4:d02\", \"start\": 72, \"end\": 186, \"text\": \"” ( Mike Miller ) Portraying Ellie , Lauren Hackett held up the other end of the show–a perfect balance to Smaha .\"}, \"D3S3\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0068-787500caa9a4:d02\", \"start\": 187, \"end\": 336, \"text\": \"From the beginning to end , she showed a brilliant interpretation of both her character ’ s personality and her mom-in-her-daughter ’ s-body acting .\"}, \"D3S4\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0068-787500caa9a4:d02\", \"start\": 337, \"end\": 509, \"text\": \"Hackett captured the micro-managing qualities of the mom while appearing to be a teenager , later showing a soft side to teenager Ellie once more after they switched back .\"}, \"D3S5\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0068-787500caa9a4:d02\", \"start\": 510, \"end\": 545, \"text\": \"She also conveyed how Katherine ’ s\"}, \"D4S1\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0068-787500caa9a4:d03\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 102, \"text\": \"Ayoob Choreographer Brynn Ayoob performed in Hillbarn Conservatory Theatre shows since middle school .\"}, \"D4S2\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0068-787500caa9a4:d03\", \"start\": 103, \"end\": 200, \"text\": \"She assisted the teen show last summer and is excited to be the choreographer for Freaky Friday !\"}, \"D4S3\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0068-787500caa9a4:d03\", \"start\": 201, \"end\": 308, \"text\": \"Brynn has loved performing her whole life and is currently a sophomore Musical Theatre major at NYU Tisch .\"}, \"D4S4\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0068-787500caa9a4:d03\", \"start\": 309, \"end\": 381, \"text\": \"She just finished a run of her first Off-Broadway show , A Chorus Line .\"}, \"D4S5\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0068-787500caa9a4:d03\", \"start\": 382, \"end\": 530, \"text\": \"She is grateful to be a part of this amazing production team , proud of these talented kids , and excited to be back home with her Hillbarn family .\"}, \"D4S6\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0068-787500caa9a4:d03\", \"start\": 531, \"end\": 555, \"text\": \"Robyn Lieu Stage Manager\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0068-787500caa9a4:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0068-787500caa9a4:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"Freaky Friday musical\", \"scope\": \"beginning of performances\", \"claim\": \"The Freaky Friday musical began its performances on October 4, 2016.\", \"answer\": \"October 4, 2016\", \"quote\": \"musical began performances at the Signature Theatre, Arlington, Virginia on October 4, 2016.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0068-787500caa9a4:d01\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0068-787500caa9a4:d01:c0\", \"entity\": \"Freaky Friday musical\", \"scope\": \"beginning of performances\", \"claim\": \"The Freaky Friday musical began its performances on January 1, 2018.\", \"answer\": \"January 1, 2018\", \"quote\": \"The musical began performances at the Signature Theatre, Arlington, Virginia on January 1, 2018.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"October 4, 2016\", \"January 1, 2018\", \"January 31, 2017\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"October 4, 2016\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"January 1, 2018\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C2\", \"answer\": \"January 31, 2017\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
